Third-Party Data and Software Attributions

MetaSplice incorporates or depends on the following third-party resources.
Users are responsible for complying with each resource's terms of use.

Bundled data
------------
- SMS 7-mer scores: Ke, S. et al. Genome Res. 28, 11-24 (2018).
  Supplementary Table S7 from PMC5749175.
- RESCUE-ESE hexamers: Fairbrother, W.G. et al. Science 297, 1007-1013 (2002).
- FAS-ESS hexamers: Wang, Z. et al. Cell 119, 831-845 (2004).

